OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith strong winds and rain Saturday.
OL,7,FDrier Sunday with light winds and
OL,8,Fcoastal showers possible. Blustery
OL,9,Fshowers through Monday, perhaps heavy
OL,10,Fat times.
